   "text": {
    "text": "GENERATED GEOMETRY LAB\nEvery exhibit here is CPU-generated each frame and uploaded through one\nprocedural-mesh path. Left to right: metaball isosurface, Game of Life,\na rotating tesseract, a Fourier contour building itself out of harmonics.\nWASD to fly. Each exhibit also has its own focused scene.",
